    (date "2026-10-10")
    (rev "1.0-prototype")
    (company "")
    (comment 1 "ESP32-S3 based video editing shortcut controller")
    (comment 2 "Prototype design - Pinout TBD, requires verification against ESP32-S3 datasheet")
    (comment 3 "6 push buttons, OLED I2C display, status LED")
    (comment 4 "GPIO assignments are preliminary and subject to change")
